{"format":"megamek-board","version":2,"size":{"width":6,"height":6},"name":"Native editor composition examples","description":"A grouped picnic (15 tables, 2 trees) under a level-4 bridge with deck paint; three independently transformed cars and a small tree; level-2 industry below a level-4 maglev train and level-5 beacon; a building design and directional cliff edges.","sourceHeader":"# Synthetic editor example. SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later\n","tags":["editor example"],"notes":[{"at":[2,2],"text":["The ground picnic group remains below the bridge. Click selects the group, a second click one table. Paint targets only the deck."]},{"at":[4,2],"text":["Select each car and tree independently. Position, rotate, mirror, or scale it."]},{"at":[2,4],"text":["Absolute level placement is independent of the industrial support below."]}],
